sequenceDiagram
  actor Reader as Độc giả
  participant UI as Frontend
  participant Gateway as API Gateway
  participant Borrow as Borrow Service
  participant Book as Book Service
  Reader->>UI: Chọn mượn sách
  UI->>Gateway: POST /api/borrows + JWT
  Gateway->>Borrow: POST /borrows + x-user-*
  Borrow->>Book: GET /books/:id
  Book-->>Borrow: Thông tin sách
  Borrow-->>Gateway: 201 PENDING
  Gateway-->>UI: Phiếu chờ duyệt
  Note over Borrow,Book: Khi thủ thư duyệt\nBorrow gọi POST /books/:id/reserve
